    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mars, 2050. Colony 1 has gone silent. As Crew 2, you arrive to investigate an intact but empty outpost. The colonists vanished without a trace, and strange entities now lurk within.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel the clues to discover the fate of Colony 1 and its survivors. Armed with sci-fi weaponry, engage in third-person shooter combat against hostile alien life forms that stalk the shadows. Explore a dynamic environment where every corner holds secrets\u2014and danger.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Third-person sci-fi shooter combat</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face hostile alien life forms</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unravel clues to uncover the fate of Colony 1</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Will you uncover the truth\u2014or join the lost?</p>",
